<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Telecasters Nth Qld says TCA seller.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Telecasters Nth Qld says TCA seller.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecasters North Queensland Ltd said on Tuesday it had sold its 14.9 percent stake in regional broadcaster Telecasters Australia Ltd.</p>
<p>The 3.0 million shares were sold for A$6.50 per share in on-market transactions, it said. Brokers earlier reported that two lines of Telecasters Australia stock, one of 3.0 million shares and another of 2.65 million shares, were specialed through Macquarie Equities in morning trade.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
